{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ZEC","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"撒迦利亞書","commonName":"撒迦利亞書","title":"撒迦利亞書","order":38,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"596e12e88f20bda085f475cd8057e433ebcfbd7db4b18a72e7597b0902128ee5","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ZEC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ZEC/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":211},"chapter":{"number":11,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["暴君的沒落"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"黎巴嫩哪，開開你的門，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"任火燒滅你的香柏樹。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"松樹啊，應當哀號；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為香柏樹傾倒，佳美的樹毀壞。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴珊的橡樹啊，應當哀號，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為茂盛的樹林已經倒了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"聽啊，有牧人哀號的聲音，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因他們榮華的草場毀壞了。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有少壯獅子咆哮的聲音，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因約旦河旁的叢林荒廢了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["兩個牧人"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["耶和華－我的上帝如此說：「你－撒迦利亞要牧養這將宰的群羊。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["買他們的宰了他們，以自己為無罪；賣他們的說：『耶和華是應當稱頌的，因我成為富足。』牧養他們的並不憐恤他們。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["耶和華說：『我不再憐恤這地的居民，必將這民交給各人的鄰舍和他們王的手中。他們必毀滅這地，我也不救這民脫離他們的手。』」"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["於是，我牧養這將宰的群羊，就是群中最困苦的羊。我拿着兩根杖，一根我稱為「榮美」，一根我稱為「聯索」。這樣，我牧養了群羊。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["一月之內，我除滅三個牧人，因為我的心厭煩他們；他們的心也憎嫌我。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["我就說：「我不牧養你們。要死的，由他死；要喪亡的，由他喪亡；餘剩的，由他們彼此相食。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["我折斷那稱為「榮美」的杖，表明我廢棄與萬民所立的約。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["當日就廢棄了。這樣，那些仰望我的困苦羊就知道所說的是耶和華的話。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["我對他們說：「你們若以為美，就給我工價。不然，就罷了！」於是他們給了三十塊錢作為我的工價。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["耶和華吩咐我說：「要把眾人所估定美好的價值丟給窯戶。」我便將這三十塊錢，在耶和華的殿中丟給窯戶了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["我又折斷稱為「聯索」的那根杖，表明我廢棄猶大與以色列弟兄的情誼。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["耶和華又吩咐我說：「你再取愚昧牧人所用的器具，"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["因我要在這地興起一個牧人。他不看顧喪亡的，不尋找分散的，不醫治受傷的，也不牧養強壯的；卻要吃肥羊的肉，撕裂牠的蹄子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"無用的牧人丟棄羊群有禍了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"刀必臨到他的膀臂和右眼上。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的膀臂必全然枯乾；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的右眼也必昏暗失明。」","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ZEC/11.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ZEC/12.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ZEC/10.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}